  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : **20 * 2 * 50 * 5 * 115**\n\nAccording to the question**, after replacing the * signs** :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : -, ×, =, +\n\n20 - **2 × 50**__ = __**5 + 115**__\n\n__**20 - 100**__ = 120\n\n-80 ≠ 120 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : +, ×, =, -\n\n20 + **2 × 50**__ = __**5 - 115**__\n\n__**20 + 100**__ = -110\n\n120 ≠ -110 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : +, ×, -, =\n\n20 + **2 × 50**__ - 5 = 115\n\n__**20 + 100**__ - 5 = 115\n\n__**120 - 5**__ = 115\n\n**115 = 115 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : -, ×, +, =\n\n20 - **2 × 50**__ + 5 = 115\n\n__**20 + 5**__ - 100 = 115\n\n__**25 - 100**__ = 115\n\n-75 ≠ 115 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
